<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">课题“申报要求”见《绍兴市教育科研管理条例》（见绍兴市教育教学研究院网<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="http://www.sxjky.com/"><SPAN style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; text-underline: none">http://www.sxjky.com</SPAN></A></SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">四、申报受理时间：</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>日～<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>日。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">五、申报程序：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 新宋体-18030">申报人填写“立项申报表”（附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．初审。各区、县（市）教科规划办公室（高校科研处）在对《立项申报表》及研究方案进行初审，择优签署意见、加盖公章后，按规定的申报数额将申报材料报送到绍兴市教育教学研究院</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 新宋体-18030">（绍兴市新河弄<SPAN lang=EN-US>66</SPAN>号，邮编<SPAN lang=EN-US>312000</SPAN>）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">张静老师处（联系电话：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; COLOR: black; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">88905970</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">）。基教类课题要求将申报材料按类别整理好，并分别按顺序打印好汇总表（附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><A><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>汇总表须同时以电子稿形式发送到sxjky2009@163.com</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 新宋体-18030">市直学校以校为单位报送。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">六、其它<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．第四轮绍兴市教育科研基地学校申报的课题从课题指南（附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）所给的方向中选择，每校可申报<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>个课题。申报时请在申报表中注明申报编号（共有<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>个编号）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
